WEBVTT

NOTE
Inside the D-District (Desert) Prison — descent through the cell shaft.
Duration: approximately 30 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.650
A descent through the D-District Prison's grim interior — rusted machinery and pipes.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.040
Numbered cell hatches line the towering shaft.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:23.980
A small caged lift sinks down the vast cylindrical core.
